freeglaz — CLI to drive the HP DesignJet Z9.

Available commands:
    freeglaz ping                          # Connection test
    freeglaz info                          # Machine identification
    freeglaz status                        # Overview (paper, ink, alerts)
    freeglaz status --json                 # Same in JSON for scripts
    freeglaz paper list                    # List papers
    freeglaz paper list --custom           # Custom papers only
    freeglaz paper list --donors           # With donor → HP paper mapping
    freeglaz paper show <id|name>          # Details of a paper

Upcoming commands:
    freeglaz paper create <name> --donor <id>
    freeglaz paper calibrate <id>
    freeglaz paper scan-only <id> --output <icc>

Configuration:
    Create a .env file at the root or export in ~/.zshrc:
        Z9_HOST=192.168.1.50
        Z9_ADMIN_PWD=...
